:"{{count}} credits remaining",upgrade:"Upgrade",upgradeAction:"Upgrade Action",warningCritical:"Warning Critical",warningLow:"Warning Low"}},cancelled:{description:"Your payment has been cancelled.",helpText:"No charges were made to your account.",retry:"Try Again",title:"Payment Cancelled"},devices:{activeNow:"Active now",confirmDisconnect:"Disconnect Device?",daysAgo:"{{count}} days ago",disconnect:"Disconnect",disconnectSuccess:"Device Disconnected",disconnectSuccessMessage:"Device has been successfully disconnected.",disconnectSuccessWithSessions:"Disconnect Success With Sessions",hoursAgo:"{{count}} hours ago",loading:"Loading devices...",minutesAgo:"{{count}} minutes ago",noDevices:"No devices connected",noDevicesDescription:"Devices will appear here when you log in on different platforms",registeredDevices:"Registered Devices",thisDevice:"This device"},liveAiDataFlow:{subtitle:"End-to-end pipeline visualization for Live AI features",tabs:{dubbing:"Dubbing",translation:"Translation",trivia:"Trivia"},title:"Live AI Data Flow",services:{elevenlabs:"ElevenLabs",googleCloud:"Google Cloud",googleTranslate:"Google Translate",openai:"OpenAI",claude:"Claude",spacy:"spaCy",redis:"Redis",tavily:"Tavily"},translation:{nodes:{auth:{title:"WebSocket Auth + Rate Limit",input:"WebSocket connection request with JWT token",output:"Authenticated session with rate limit applied"},quota:{title:"Quota Check (30s cache)",input:"User ID and feature type",output:"Quota validation result (cached 30s)"},stt:{title:"STT (ElevenLabs Scribe v2)",input:"Raw audio stream from channel",output:"Transcribed text segments with timestamps"},dedup:{title:"Deduplication (70% overlap)",input:"New transcript segment",output:"Filtered unique segments (70% overlap threshold)"},predictive:{title:"Predictive Subtitle Emit (optional)",input:"Original language transcript",output:"Early subtitle display before translation"},translate:{title:"Translation (Google/OpenAI/Claude)",input:"Original language text segment",output:"Translated text in target language"},chunk:{title:"Text Chunking (max 80 chars)",input:"Translated text of any length",output:"Chunks of max 80 characters for display"},emit:{title:"Final Subtitle Emit",input:"Chunked translated subtitle",output:"WebSocket event to client with subtitle data"}}},dubbing:{nodes:{auth:{title:"WebSocket Auth + Rate Limit",input:"WebSocket connection request with JWT token",output:"Authenticated session with rate limit applied"},quota:{title:"Quota Check",input:"User ID and dubbing feature type",output:"Quota validation result"},session:{title:"Session Init + ChannelSTTManager Subscribe",input:"Channel ID and language preferences",output:"Subscribed to shared STT channel manager"},stt:{title:"Shared STT (1 per channel, 99% cost save)",input:"Channel audio stream (shared across users)",output:"Shared transcript for all channel subscribers"},transcriptEmit:{title:"Transcript Emit to Client",input:"Shared STT transcript segment",output:"WebSocket event with original transcript"},translate:{title:"Translation",input:"Original transcript text",output:"Translated text in user's target language"},translationEmit:{title:"Translation Emit to Client",input:"Translated text segment",output:"WebSocket event with translated text"},tts:{title:"TTS Streaming (new conn per transcript)",input:"Translated text for speech synthesis",output:"Streaming audio chunks from ElevenLabs"},encode:{title:"Audio Encoding (base64)",input:"Raw audio buffer from TTS",output:"Base64-encoded audio ready for transport"},audioEmit:{title:"Dubbed Audio Emit",input:"Encoded audio chunk",output:"WebSocket event with dubbed audio data"}}},trivia:{nodes:{auth:{title:"WebSocket Auth + Rate Limit",input:"WebSocket connection request with JWT token",output:"Authenticated session with rate limit applied"},quota:{title:"Quota Check (fact-based)",input:"User ID and trivia feature type",output:"Quota validation (per-fact billing)"},topic:{title:"Topic Detection (NER)",input:"Transcript text from live channel",output:"Detected named entities and topics"},mention:{title:"Mention Tracking (min 2, 60-min cooldown)",input:"Detected entity with mention count",output:"Eligible topic (2+ mentions, not in cooldown)"},session:{title:"Session Management (FIFO max 100)",input:"New trivia session request",output:"Session slot allocated (FIFO eviction at 100)"},cache:{title:"Fact Cache Lookup (24h TTL)",input:"Topic entity for fact lookup",output:"Cached fact if available (24h TTL)"},search:{title:"Web Search (cache miss only)",input:"Topic entity needing fresh facts",output:"Web search results from Tavily"},extract:{title:"Fact Extraction (cache miss only)",input:"Web search results for topic",output:"Structured trivia fact extracted by AI"},tracking:{title:"Session Tracking + Interval (15s min)",input:"Generated trivia fact",output:"Fact queued with 15s minimum interval"},emit:{title:"Trivia Fact Emit (multilingual)",input:"Trivia fact with translations",output:"WebSocket event with multilingual trivia"}}}},pending:{description:"Your payment is being processed. Please wait...",helpText:"This usually takes a few seconds. Do not close this page.",takingLonger:"This is taking longer than expected...",timeElapsed:"Time elapsed: {{time}}",title:"Payment Processing"},privacy:{children:{content:"While our content is suitable for all ages, Olorin.ai LLC does not knowingly collect personal identifiable information from children under the age of 13. If you are a parent and believe your child has provided us with personal information, please contact us.",title:"5. Children\\"},collection:{audio:{data:"Data Collected: Brief audio samples of the TV broadcast.",intro:"If you utilize features requiring audio synchronization, the App may request Microphone access.",purpose:"Purpose: To match the audio fingerprint of the public broadcast for synchronization purposes.",retention:"Retention: Like visual data, audio samples are processed in real-time and immediately deleted. We do not listen to or record user conversations.",title:"Title"},camera:{data:"Data",intro:"To provide our core service\u2014synchronizing translated audio with your TV\u2014Bayit+ requires access to your device\\",purpose:"Purpose",retention:"Retention: This data is ephemeral. The frames are processed instantly in memory and are permanently deleted immediately after the synchronization is established. We do not view, store, or archive images of your home or family.",title:"A. Camera & Visual Synchronization Data"},title:"2. Information We Collect & How We Use It",usage:{aggregate:"Aggregate",content:"We may collect non-identifiable technical data to improve App stability, including:",crash:"Crash logs and performance metrics.",device:"Device type and operating system version.",title:"C. Usage & Technical Data"}},contact:{intro:"If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:",title:"7. Contact Us"},intro:{commitment:'We built Bayit+ with a "Privacy-First" architecture. We do not record your living room. Our technology uses your device\\',content:"Content",title:"1. Introduction"},lastUpdated:"Last Updated: January 27, 2026",retention:{account:"Account Data: Retained only as long as your account is active to manage your subscription and preferences.",sync:"Sync",title:"4. Data Retention"},rights:{content:"Depending on your location, you may have the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data. You may delete your Bayit+ account at any time within the App settings.",title:"6. Your Rights"},sharing:{ai:"AI Processing: Services used to generate real-time text and audio translations from public broadcast feeds.",cloud:"Cloud",noSale:"Olorin.ai LLC does not sell your personal data. We partner with trusted third-party service providers to deliver our infrastructure. These providers are authorized to use your data only as necessary to provide these services to us:",title:"3. Data Sharing and Third Parties"}},semantic:{info:"AI-powered search understands meaning, not just keywords",infoTitle:"Semantic Search",keyword:"Keyword",semantic:"Semantic"},success:{continue:"Continue",description:"Your payment has been processed successfully.",redirecting:"Redirecting...",title:"Payment Successful"},suggestions:{categoriesTitle:"Categories",clearRecent:"Clear Recent",recentTitle:"Recent Searches",trendingTitle:"Trending"},viewMode:{cards:"Cards",grid:"Grid",list:"List"},widget:{"103fmEpisodes":"103FM Episodes",audioUnavailable:"Audio unavailable",contentUnavailable:"Content unavailable",errorLoadingContent:"Error loading content",iframeNotConfigured:"iFrame URL not configured",loadingEpisodes:"Loading episodes...",loadingNews:"Loading news...",noContentConfigured:"No content configured",noEpisodesFound:"No episodes found",podcastUnavailable:"Podcast unavailable",stationUnavailable:"Station unavailable",streamUnavailable:"Stream unavailable",unknownComponent:"Unknown component: {{componentName}}",ynetBreakingNews:"\u05de\u05d1\u05d6\u05e7\u05d9 Ynet"},auth:{loginRequired:"Login Required",loginToWatch:"Please sign in to watch {{title}}",login:"Login",signUp:"Sign Up",signInRequired:"Sign In Required",signInRequiredTitle:"Please sign in to continue"},email:{greeting:"Hello",footer:{privacy:"Privacy Policy",terms:"Terms of Service",support:"Support",unsubscribe:"Unsubscribe from these emails"},welcome:{subject:"Welcome to Bayit+!",title:"Welcome to Bayit+",body:"Thank you for joining Bayit+. We're excited to have you on board!",cta:"Go to Dashboard"},verification:{subject:"Verify Your Email",title:"Verify Your Email Address",body:"Please click the button below to verify your email address.",cta:"Verify Email",expiry:"This link will expire in {expiry_hours} hours.",security:"If you didn't create an account, you can safely ignore this email."},verification_resend:{subject:"Email Verification (Resent)",title:"Verify Your Email Address",body:"Here's a new verification link as requested.",cta:"Verify Email"},password_reset:{subject:"Reset Your Password",title:"Reset Your Password",body:"We received a request to reset your password. Click the button below to create a new password.",cta:"Reset Password",expiry:"This link will expire in {expiry_hours} hours.",security:"If you didn't request this, your account is still safe. You can ignore this email."},password_changed:{subject:"Password Changed",title:"Your Password Has Been Changed",body:"Your password was successfully changed.",security:"If you didn't make this change, please contact support immediately."},account_locked:{subject:"Account Locked",title:"Your Account Has Been Locked",body:"Your account has been temporarily locked due to security concerns.",cta:"Unlock Account"},beta_invitation:{subject:"You're Invited to Bayit+ Beta!",title:"You're Invited to the Beta Program",body:"Congratulations! You've been selected for the exclusive Bayit+ Beta 500 program.",credits:"{credits} AI credits included",duration:"Access for {days} days",cta:"Join Beta Program"},beta_welcome:{subject:"Welcome to Bayit+ Beta!",title:"Welcome to the Beta Program",body:"You're now part of the exclusive Bayit+ Beta 500 community!",cta:"Get Started"},payment_confirmation:{subject:"Payment Confirmation",title:"Payment Received",body:"Your payment has been processed successfully.",transaction:"Transaction ID",plan:"Plan",amount:"Amount",date:"Payment Date",next_billing:"Next Billing Date"},subscription_activated:{subject:"Subscription Activated",title:"Your Subscription is Active",body:"Your subscription has been activated. Here's what you get:",cta:"Start Watching"},subscription_cancelled:{subject:"Subscription Cancelled",title:"Subscription Cancelled",body:"Your subscription has been cancelled. You'll continue to have access until {access_until}.",cta:"Reactivate Subscription"},payment_failed:{subject:"Payment Failed",title:"Payment Failed",body:"We were unable to process your payment. Please update your paymen