ocation for 24 hours\n\nWe will NOT:\n\u2022 Track your exact location\n\u2022 Share your location with third parties\n\u2022 Store your location permanently without consent\n\nYou can change this anytime in settings.",accept:"Allow Location Access",decline:"Not Now",privacyNote:"Your privacy is important. Location data is encrypted and never sold."},permissionBanner:{title:"Discover Israeli Content Near You",description:"Enable location services to see Israeli community events, news, and stories from your area. Your privacy is protected - we only detect your city.",ariaLabel:"Location services prompt",enable:"Enable Location",notNow:"Not Now",dismiss:"Dismiss location prompt",close:"Close banner"},status:{detecting:"Detecting your location...",detected:"Location detected: {{city}}, {{state}}",denied:"Location access denied",unavailable:"Location services unavailable",error:"Failed to detect location"},errors:{permissionDenied:"Location access denied. Please enable location in your browser settings.",timeout:"Location request timed out. Please try again.",unavailable:"Location services are not available in your browser.",failed:"Failed to get location. Please try again."}},payment:{pending:{title:"Complete Your Subscription",description:"Choose a plan to start your 7-day free trial and access all of Bayit+",timeElapsed:"Checking payment status... ({{seconds}}s)",takingLonger:"Payment confirmation is taking longer than expected. Please try refreshing or contact support if you've already paid.",helpText:"Need help? Contact support@bayit.tv or refresh this page if you already completed payment."},continueToPayment:"Continue to Payment",success:{title:"Payment Successful!",description:"Welcome to Bayit+! Your subscription is now active.",redirecting:"Redirecting in {{seconds}} seconds...",continue:"Continue to Bayit+"},cancelled:{title:"Payment Cancelled",description:"Your subscription was not completed. You can try again when you're ready.",retry:"Try Again",helpText:"